    "handle": "jxgjcb666",
    "name": "Jiangxi Daily",
    "text": "📍From C909 to C929: How Nanchang Supports China's Large Aircraft Dream\n\n👍From October 31st to November 2nd, The 2025 Nanchang Air Show and Aviation Industry Expo was held at Nanchang Yaohu Airport. Since 2019, Nanchang has successfully hosted seven consecutive airshows, attracting a total of approximately 1.3 million on-site audiences.\n\nLarge aircraft are a national strategic asset, embodying the glory and dreams of generations of aviation professionals. As the birthplace of \"Nanchang CJ-5\" -- New China's first domestically developed aircraft -- Nanchang is privileged to be part of the \"full-model\" industrial chain of China's in-production (and under-development) aircraft, spanning from regional aircraft to mainline large aircraft.\n\nOn May 27th, a brand-new C909 aircraft was officially delivered to China Southern Airlines Hubei Branch at COMAC Jiangxi Production and Test Flight Center. As of 2025, the total number of C909 aircraft delivered by COMAC (Jiangxi) in Nanchang accounts for approximately one-third of the national total deliveries.\n\nOn October 27th, 2023, at the 2023 China Aviation Industry Conference and Nanchang Airshow, an official announcement was made regarding the C929, China's independently developed large jetliner. The letter \"R\" -- which originally stood for the cooperation with Russia -- has been removed, thus symbolizing that the C929 project has entered the independent R&D phase. On June 29th, 2024, the integrated production project of the C929 composite material fuselage section kicked off officially in Nanchang. Currently, its construction is progressing smoothly and is expected to be completed by the end of 2026.\n\n@xuejianosaka @zhang_heqing @salahzhang @consulat_de @ChenPingMFA @CGMeifangZhang\n\n#Nanchang #Jiangxi #China #JiangxiRising #Development #Aircraft #Technology #NeverGiveUp #AircraftIndustry #Plane #Ailplane #The2025NanchangAirShowAndAviationIndustryExpo",
